flowchart LR
    A[Prompt / Policy / Guardrail Change] --> B[Version Control]
    B --> C[Review and Approval]
    C --> D[Regression Tests]
    D --> E[Golden Conversations]
    E --> F[Jailbreak and Injection Tests]
    F --> G[Canary Release]
    G --> H{Production Signals Healthy?}
    H -- Yes --> I[Promote]
    H -- No --> J[Rollback]
    I --> K[Record Version and Evidence]
    J --> K
